---
layout: base.njk
description: Evie (Yuxin) Hou — sociology, AI systems, research infrastructure, projects and notes.
---
{% from 'entries.njk' import entryList %}
<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <h1 id="intro-title">Yuxin Hou <span lang="zh-CN">侯煜欣</span></h1>
  <p>{{ portfolio.intro }}</p>
  <p class="academic-role">{{ portfolio.role }}</p>
  <div class="intro-links"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email</a><a href="{{ site.github }}">GitHub</a><a href="/about/">About</a></div>
</section>
<section class="assistant-panel" aria-labelledby="assistant-title">
  <div class="assistant-heading">
    <div class="agent-identity">
      <svg class="agent-computer" viewBox="0 0 88 76" role="img" aria-labelledby="computer-title"><title id="computer-title">Portfolio assistant: pencil-line computer</title>
        <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path class="pencil-echo" d="M13 9 L75 10 L76 53 L12 52 Z M9 67 L80 67"/>
          <path d="M12 8 L75 9 L75 53 L12 52 Z" stroke-width="1.3"/>
          <path d="M18 15 L69 15 L68 44 L18 44 Z" stroke-width="1"/>
          <path d="M36 53 L35 62 M51 53 L52 62 M28 63 L59 63 M10 68 L78 68" stroke-width="1.2"/>
          <path d="M24 25 L29 29 L24 33" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <path class="agent-cursor" d="M35 33 L43 33" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <path class="agent-processing" d="M35 25 L60 25 M35 29 L55 29" stroke-width="1"/>
          <path d="M15 56 L20 57 M15 59 L24 60 M65 56 L70 57 M63 59 L70 60" stroke-width=".65" opacity=".45"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div><h2 id="assistant-title">Portfolio assistant</h2><p class="agent-subtitle">Questions, grounded in public sources.</p></div>
    </div>
    <span id="assistant-mode" class="mode-label">Local demo</span>
  </div>
  <p id="greeting">Ask about my background, projects, or research interests.</p>
  <div id="conversation" class="conversation" role="log" aria-label="Portfolio conversation" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions"></div>
  <form id="chat-form"><label class="sr-only" for="question">Ask about Evie or her projects</label><div class="chat-input"><input id="question" name="question" placeholder="Ask a question about my work" maxlength="400" required autocomplete="off"><button type="submit">Send</button></div></form>
  <div class="suggestions"><span>Try:</span><button type="button" data-question="Tell me about SSDataAgent">SSDataAgent</button><button type="button" data-question="Tell me about Mind Imprint">Mind Imprint</button><button type="button" data-question="Tell me about Evie">Background</button></div>
  <p id="chat-status" class="source-note" role="status">Curated answers, not live AI. Nothing you type is sent or saved.</p>
  <div id="live-options" class="live-options" hidden>
    <label><input id="live-consent" type="checkbox"> Use live AI: send my submitted questions and a time-of-day category to this site’s server and DeepSeek. Don’t include private information. Provider retention policies apply.</label>
    <div><button id="enable-live" type="button">Connect to live AI</button><button id="enable-demo" type="button">Use local demo</button></div>
  </div>
  <details class="privacy-details"><summary>Sources and privacy</summary><p>This AI portfolio assistant uses only the reviewed public facts on this site. The current local demo uses topic matching, not a language model. Optional live mode requires explicit opt-in. Neither mode has access to private files, account credentials, location, or chat history.</p><a href="/about/#sources">Read the source and privacy notes</a></details>
  <noscript><p>The interactive guide requires JavaScript. All profile information and source links are available below.</p></noscript>
</section>
<section id="projects" class="home-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Selected projects</h2><a href="/projects/">All projects</a></div>
  <p class="section-intro">Selected from public GitHub repositories for their relevance to social research, applied AI, and reproducible systems.</p>
  {% include 'project-cards.njk' %}
  {% set projects = entries | section('projects') | selected %}
  {% if projects.length %}{{ entryList(projects, 'h3') }}{% else %}<p class="empty-state">Detailed project case studies are being prepared.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
<section id="interests" class="home-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Background and interests</h2><a href="/about/">About</a></div>
  <p class="section-intro">{{ portfolio.approach }}</p>
  <figure class="profile-figure" aria-labelledby="domain-heading">
    <div class="figure-heading"><h3 id="domain-heading">Domain self-assessment</h3><span class="chart-status">Illustrative values</span></div>
    <p class="source-note">Editable example scores on a 0–5 scale. These are not Evie’s self-ratings or objective proficiency measurements.</p>
    <div class="radar-layout">
      <svg id="radar" viewBox="0 0 380 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="radar-title radar-desc">
        <title id="radar-title">Domain radar — illustrative example values</title>
        <desc id="radar-desc">{{ visualizations.description }}</desc>
        <g id="radar-grid">
          {% for ring in visualizations.rings %}<polygon points="{{ ring.points }}" fill="none" stroke="#dce1e6" stroke-width="1"/>{% endfor %}
          {% for axis in visualizations.axes %}<line x1="190" y1="143" x2="{{ axis.end.x }}" y2="{{ axis.end.y }}" stroke="#dce1e6"/>{% endfor %}
        </g>
        <polygon id="radar-shape" points="{{ visualizations.initialPoints }}" fill="#285a83" fill-opacity=".1" stroke="#285a83" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <g id="radar-labels" fill="#636972" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">{% for axis in visualizations.axes %}<text x="{{ axis.labelPoint.x }}" y="{{ axis.labelPoint.y + 4 }}">{{ axis.label }}</text>{% endfor %}</g>
        <g fill="#636972" font-size="10" text-anchor="start"><text x="195" y="147">0</text>{% for ring in visualizations.rings %}<text x="195" y="{{ ring.y + 4 }}">{{ ring.level }}</text>{% endfor %}</g>
      </svg>
      <div class="score-editor"><p class="control-heading">Edit example values</p>{% for domain in portfolio.domains %}<label>{{ domain }} <input type="range" min="0" max="5" step="1" value="{{ portfolio.illustrativeScores[loop.index0] }}" data-domain="{{ loop.index0 }}"><output>{{ portfolio.illustrativeScores[loop.index0] }}/5</output></label>{% endfor %}<button id="reset-radar" type="button">Reset placeholders</button><p class="source-note">Edits stay in this page and reset on reload.</p></div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>Self-assessment pending. The plotted shape demonstrates the chart; it makes no claim about actual capability.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <figure class="profile-figure" aria-labelledby="timeline-heading">
    <div class="figure-heading"><h3 id="timeline-heading">Academic timeline</h3><span class="chart-status">Dates pending</span></div>
    <p class="source-note">Milestones from Evie’s supplied profile. Start and end dates have not been confirmed.</p>
    <ol class="academic-timeline" aria-label="Academic milestones with unconfirmed dates">
      <li><span class="timeline-date">Dates to confirm</span><h4>Peking University</h4><p>Third-year Sociology PhD student.</p></li>
      <li><span class="timeline-date">Dates to confirm</span><h4>Princeton University</h4><p>One-year Visiting Student Research Collaborator.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <figcaption>Milestone order only. Spacing does not represent elapsed time; overlapping appointments and life-status ratings are not plotted. <a href="/about/#sources">Source: owner-supplied profile</a>.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<section class="home-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Notes and technical reports</h2><a href="/reports/">All reports</a></div>
  {% set reports = entries | section('reports') | firstEntries %}
  {% if reports.length %}{{ entryList(reports, 'h3') }}{% else %}<p class="empty-state">No notes or technical reports published yet.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
<script type="module" src="/assets/portfolio.js"></script>
